      "text": "Nephi1 is constrained by the Spirit to kill Laban, 1 Ne. 4:10. the Spirit constrains Nephi1 to speak, 1 Ne. 7:15 (2 Ne. 4:14; 28:1). the Spirit constrains Alma2 not to stretch forth hand on behalf of martyrs, Alma 14:11. Ammaron is constrained by the Spirit to hide up records, 4 Ne. 1:48.",
